{
  "name": "about-devotion",
  "label": "A path of devotion",
  "description": "Brought across from a page made elsewhere; every word, picture and link is a field.",
  "version": 1,
  "fields": {
    "body": {
      "kind": "richText",
      "label": "Body",
      "marks": [
        "bold",
        "italic",
        "link"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        "paragraph",
        "heading",
        "bulletList",
        "orderedList",
        "blockquote"
      ]
    }
  },
  "defaults": {
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A path of devotion"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "My path began at age 17, when I discovered yoga. Through the returning of the truth I discovered within myself, I began to awaken to the truth beneath the masks of the world, and I knew I had a role to play in helping this human world heal and remember its true nature, from the inside out and the outside in."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I devoted myself to multiple studies and practices in wellness arts, earth arts, community arts, mystic arts, and performing arts. I invested myself in the arts of rewilding, of returning to the original ways, and of learning how to bridge the magic of soul with the modern world of ego, without abandoning any reality."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ultimately, I am here for this Great Remembering, which is also the Great Awakening, taking up my many hats in order to steward a revolution, an evolution, within self and culture. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We revolve to evolve.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "template": "<section class=\"paper i-devotion\">{{rich body class=\"wrap\"}}</section>",
  "css": ":scope{--paper:#f6f1e4;--brown:#472d1e;--ink:var(--os-color-text);--serif:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;--sans:'Hanken Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;--gap:clamp(56px,9vw,120px)}\n:scope{color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}\n:where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6){color:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-weight:bold;font-style:inherit;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;line-height:inherit;text-wrap:wrap}\n:where(h1){font-size:2em}:where(h2){font-size:1.5em}:where(h3){font-size:1.17em}:where(h4){font-size:1em}:where(h5){font-size:.83em}:where(h6){font-size:.67em}\n:where(.os-ci){display:inline-block;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;aspect-ratio:auto}\n.os-ci>picture{display:contents}\n.os-ci img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:inherit;object-position:inherit;border-radius:inherit}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nh2{font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--brown);font-weight:500;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 .5em}\nh2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.1rem)}\np{margin:0 0 1.1em;max-width:62ch}\n.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}\nsection{padding:var(--gap) 0}\n.paper{background:var(--paper)}",
  "section": {
    "width": "full",
    "padding": {
      "d": "none"
    }
  }
}
